  "summary": "Burundi’s migration authority (CGM) issues the single-entry visa (one month) online, at Melchior Ndadaye International Airport or at embassies, but does not publish which nationalities need one; the UK and Canadian governments say their citizens need a visa. East African Community citizens can get a free EAC entry visa from the CGM, valid for 1 to 6 months.",
